[{"client_msg_id":"e24778bd-bca5-4c8b-83f3-3252667511d2","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"docker も rootless で使えば同じような問題起きるのでしょうが、\nrootless で使っている人見たことない\n\nデフォルトインストールで dockerd (containerd ?)が root もってるから、そのあたり意識しないで使えるのが、docker のとっつきやすさでもあるんですよね。","ts":"1619165030.025500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U1+B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"DE8125B2-3E6A-4860-802A-518E02CC6B76","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"試したことない","ts":"1619165014.025300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yfmf0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"E36A13B8-6A93-4D73-863A-35422B554DD1","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"dockerのrootlessも同じなんすかね","ts":"1619165011.025100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8f9R="}]},{"client_msg_id":"1c6bce03-8096-4e63-a4bf-a72bf319905c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"rootlessコンテナ面倒なのめっちゃわかる","ts":"1619164875.022600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"orr/M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c4e6e630-c022-44ab-9a53-cb91514ec781","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"podman, rootless だし気に入ってるんですが\n基本 rootless ゆえに\n• ネットワークとかデフォルトで作成できないとか\n• その関係で docker-compose （最近サポートした）が rootless だとうまく動かないとか\n• subuid/subgid あたり多少理解した方がいいとか\nいろいろ障壁があって、普段使いとして普及するのはなかなか難しいのではという所感。\n\n個人的な開発ベストプラクティスは「Makefile 書いて頑張る」","ts":"1619164422.021300","edited":{"user":"UPWFF5YQ7","ts":"1619164493.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U8CC7MDCL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sDe"}]}]
